# Agent workflow (squid-lib)

## Before any implementation

1. Read **`.cursor/ORCHESTRATION.md`** — full rule/skill map and execution order after prompting.
2. Apply **`library-guardrails.mdc`** — which sub-rules apply to this task.
3. User message + attached files.

## Order of truth (during the task)

1. Matching **`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`** for the file glob or task type (see ORCHESTRATION).
2. **Skills** by user name or task match: **component-creation**, **form-validation**, **library-distribution**, **planned-overlays**, **frontend-design** (marketing only).

## Always run after substantive UI/TS changes

From `component-lib-frontend/`: `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build`.

